<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Telemig Jan-May net 139 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Telemig Jan-May net 139 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian federal telecommunications company Telemig, a unit of the federal Telebras system, on Thursday released the following preliminary consolidated financial results for the January-May period.</p>
<p>				Jan-May 1997</p>
<p>    Net			 139.654 million</p>
<p>    Gross revenues	  708.031 million</p>
<p>    Net operating revenue 543.883 million</p>
<p>    Operating profit	208.457 million</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	   209.837 million</p>
<p>Note: figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement its net worth totaled 3.167 bln reais in the January-May period.</p>
<p>It also said consolidated installed fixed lines reached 1.609 million while cellular terminals totaled 294,494 in the period.</p>
<p>((-- Adrian Dickson, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5410))</p>
